			description: [
				"胸甲。标准配备，每个新屠夫都会收到，也是本幕几乎所有军官制服的基础材料。"
				"If you lose it, &#ff6b6b&lDo not&r panic: the standard uniform is one of only two armour pieces in this mod with a crafting recipe of its own. Everything else is built on top of this one."
				"&#9ad36b&l提示&r：这是需要保护的插槽。胸甲能让你在挨打后活下来，而不是被打下悬崖。"
